---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us - R. Present"
  description="Independent jeweler creating handcrafted jewelry, made in America"
>
  <article class="about-content">
    <section class="intro col-container">
      <div class="col-1">
        <img src="/images/artist.jpg" alt="About the artist" />
      </div>
      <div class="col-2">
        <p>
          Hi, this is R.<br />
          Welcome to my Art Project, coping mechanism, side hustle, hobby, time, money,
          and energy investment sample register.
        </p>
        <p>
          Seattle, 2024; what began as a quiet exploration evolved through
          jewelry school @PRATT, and many looong hours of experimentation at my
          little home studio, a space where ideas take shape.
        </p>
        <p>
          Tons of local markets, many unique individual pieces, and looots of
          human support; today, an artistic collective, @Siderail, welcomed me
          to nourish and inspire my practice, and I'll keep going.
        </p>
        <p>
          Jewelry, for me, is a form of <strong>representation</strong>: every
          piece is a little story, a feeling, a <em>fragment of identity</em>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Love,<br />
          Rhina Navas,<br />R.
        </p>

        <h2>r.Presenting!!!!</h2>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Connect With Us</h2>
      <p>Follow our journey and see new creations:</p>
      <ul class="social-links">
        <li>
          <a href="https://instagram.com/r.present.s" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
            >Instagram</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-content {
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .col-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .col-container .col-1 {
    flex-basis: 45%;
  }

  .col-container .col-1 img {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .col-container .col-2 {
    flex-basis: 45%;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .social-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .social-links li {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .social-links a {
    color: #333;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .social-links a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .col-container {
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>
